      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You're talking about post-processing effects. I just figured out how to use them in my worlds only a couple of days ago, and i thought to myself, \"Wow, VRChat should encourage users to do this in every world, this is way too good to be left out,\" until I noticed how it effected my FPS rate, then I wasn't sure what to say about that. But using this with cameras would make hell of a great feature, since cameras are sort of optional anyways. This would definitely make VRChat feel a little bit more like Garry's Mod.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
