      "value": "@{59c0e5cd39a9874475bcbfd7|full_name}: \nI have never feel to be slow by current camera effect in VR mode.\nThis function is affected local only. If my machine is slow by shader,  This don't affect another users.\nIf my idea is bad, I think this function addable another way.",
      "viewerReactions": null
